(7253980, 1127793, 25773, '<td valign="top">Very impressive concept. Not sure how fond I am of the background though... Also, this image would be more effective if larger because its strength is in the details; cropping to portrait could have done some enlargement...<br/>Still an 8 from me.</td>', 'Very impressive concept. Not sure how fond I am of the background though... Also, this image would be more effective if larger because its strength is in the details; cropping to portrait could have done some enlargement...Still an 8 from me.', '2014-08-23 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
