(7260095, 1127400, 115814, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Comment<br/> <br/>A refreshing take on the challenge, which seemed to be full of fantasy more than surrealism. I enjoyed the creative titling and was impressed to see this is an iPhone image. I also like the subtle color palette and the graceful interplay of the the arcs that define the lines throughout the image. Well done.</td>', 'Critique Club Comment A refreshing take on the challenge, which seemed to be full of fantasy more than surrealism. I enjoyed the creative titling and was impressed to see this is an iPhone image. I also like the subtle color palette and the graceful interplay of the the arcs that define the lines throughout the image. Well done.', '2014-09-06 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
